</ul>
<p>The legacy UI has been removed as part of the 2.0 transition — by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/keiko233/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/keiko233">@keiko233</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4322568188" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/issues/4508" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4508/hovercard" href="https://github.com/libnyanpasu/clash-nyanpasu/pull/4508">#4508</a>.</p>
<h2>Traffic Analytics</h2>
